<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.3.3">
<l>uṉakkup paṇicey tirukkun tavamuṭai yēṉiṉip pōyoruvaṉ</l>
<l>taṉakkup paṇintu kaṭaittalai niṟkainiṉ cāyai yaḻivukaṇṭāy</l>
<l>puṉattiṉai kiḷḷip putuvavi kāṭṭiyuṉ poṉṉaṭi vāḻkaveṉṟu</l>
<l>iṉakkuṟa varputiya tuṇṇu meḻiltiru māliruñ cōlaiyentāy.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>I have the tapas that occurs from doing service to you.</l>
<l rend="indent">[If] now [I] went [and] stood at the entrance,</l>
<l rend="indent">serving someone else,</l>
<l rend="indent">it would damage your fame, see!</l>
<l>My Father of beautiful Tirumāliruñcōlai where groups of hill people</l>
<l rend="indent">pluck millet from the uplands, giving [them as] fresh offerings,</l>
<l rend="indent">saying “May your golden feet prosper!”</l>
<l rend="indent">and [then] consuming the fresh cooked rice.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
